'''Working Vacation''' (ワーケーション, ''Wākēshon'', '''Workation''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Massive Damage" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

